      type: {class: TrackedUGuiGraphic, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.PropertyVariants.TrackedObjects, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_Target: {fileID: 2346239092687207147}
        m_TrackedProperties:
          items:
          - rid: 1159296779615993857
        m_UpdateType: 0
    - rid: 1159296779615993857
      type: {class: StringTrackedProperty, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.PropertyVariants.TrackedProperties, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_PropertyPath: m_text
        m_VariantData:
        - localeIdentifier:
            m_Code: en
          value: '<style="TitleTuto">ATTACK</style>


            To attack you need
            to <style="W1">hold</style> the {ATTACK} button and press consecutively
            {ATTACK_UPGRADE} to reach a step bar <style="W1">marked </style> on the
            conviction bar with a <style="W1">black bar</style> and on release  {ATTACK}
            will consume your entire  <style="Conviction">conviction bar </style>
            highlighted on the bottom of the screen, each reached step will <style="W1">multiply
            the damage </style>of your attack.'
        - localeIdentifier:
            m_Code: fr
          value: "<style=\"TitleTuto\">ATTAQUE</style>\r\n\r\nPour attaquer, vous
            devez <style=\"W1\">maintenir</style> le bouton {ATTACK} et <style=\"W1\">appuyer
            successivement</style> sur {ATTACK_UPGRADE} pour atteindre une barre
            de progression <style=\"W1\">indiqu\xE9e</style> sur la barre de conviction
            par <style=\"W1\">une barre noire</style>. Rel\xE2chez ensuite {ATTACK}
            pour consommer toute votre <style=\"Conviction\"> barre de conviction</style>
            surlign\xE9 en bas de l'\xE9cran. Chaque \xE9tape de progression atteinte
            <style=\"W1\">multiplie les d\xE9g\xE2ts</style> de votre attaque."
